===SPI clerks encouraged===
22) If a [[Wikipedia:Sockpuppet investigations/SPI/Clerks|sockpuppet investigations clerk]] or member of the CheckUser team feels that third-party input is not helpful at an investigation, they are encouraged to use their [[Wikipedia:Sockpuppet investigations/SPI/Clerk and checkuser procedures#Patrolling|existing authority]] to ask users to stop posting to that investigation or to SPI as a whole.

In addition to clerks and members of the CheckUser team, patrolling administrators [[Wikipedia:Sockpuppet investigations/SPI/Clerks#Admin patrollers|may remove or collapse]] contributions that impede the efficient resolution of investigations without warning.

